    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "The monthly rainfall in Rockwaters has a mean of 55 mm and a standard deviation of 1.8 mm. What is the monthly rainfall if the standardised score was 3.2? Give your answer to 1 decimal place.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$60.8\\text{ mm}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}x&=\\mu+z\\sigma\\\\x&=55+3.2(1.8)\\\\x&=60.76\\end{aligned}$$\nThe monthly rainfall is $60.8\\text{ mm}$, to 1 decimal place.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
